b.com/users/scgm0/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-05T11:53:31Z","updated_at":"2026-03-05T11:53:31Z","body":"> It's probably can be static member of RTL as well.\n\nIt should be this one.\n<img width=\"420\" height=\"74\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c4660f1a-643e-450c-a1ba-836ac76c39ee\" />\n\n<img width=\"582\" height=\"254\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ba72f0b1-2a14-4e2e-aafd-fe36ebac077a\" />","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4004524730/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4004542796","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116925#issuecomment-4004542796","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116925","id":4004542796,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7usHlM","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-05T11:56:52Z","updated_at":"2026-03-05T11:56:52Z","body":"> It should be this one.\n\nYes, simply changing it to `static inline RID_PtrOwner<Item> items;` decrease memory usage significantly (93→23 for one button click in MRP, 284→57 for 3 clicks).\n\nAnd it should not have negative effects, RID must be unique within RTL instance, it does not matter if they are globally unique, and it's never iterating over the full list of RIDs.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4004542796/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]